{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_221_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，王正月，公侵齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"二、公至自侵齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"三、二月，公侵齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"四、三月，公至自侵齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"公如，往時致月，危致也。往月致時，危往也。往月致月，惡之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"五、曹伯露卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"六、夏，齊國夏帥師伐我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"七、公會晉師於瓦。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"八、公至自瓦。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"九、秋，七月，戊辰，陳侯柳卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十、晉士鞅帥師侵鄭，遂侵衞。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十一、葬曹靖公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十二、九月，葬陳懷公。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十三、季孫斯、仲孫何忌帥師侵衞。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十四、冬，衞侯、鄭伯盟於曲濮。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十五、從祀先公。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"貴復正也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"十六、盜竊寶玉、大弓。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_221_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_221","textTraditional":"寶玉者，封圭也。大弓者，武王之戎弓也。周公受賜，藏之魯。非其所以與人而與人，謂之亡；非其所取而取之，謂之盜。","sentenceOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}